    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: At each generation compute the population correlation between pre-development and post-development fitness in replicated evolvable-competency runs. Persistence of a substantial correlation beyond about 20 generations would refute the claim.";
